+- AC5 — `bun test` is still 253 pass / 0 fail, exit 0.
+- AC6 — `src/host/m4-proof.ts` is the ONLY file you changed.
+
+## Tests
+
+Run all three, with `PATH="$HOME/.bun/bin:$PATH"`, from the repo root:
